descriptionByLocale.en:
The Valais Hospital is looking for a: Security Engineer 100% for Information Technology, Operations Unit You play a key role in the modernisation and security of IT infrastructure, while supporting innovative projects with high human and technological impact. Ready to meet various technical challenges and collaborate with passionate teams? Join us without waiting! Mission:
• Ensure the protection of the institution's digital assets, IT security management and innovative projects involving ICT components;
• participate in the operation of our SOC, the processing of security events and the optimization of detection rules (DaC);
• intervene within our CSIRT to manage incidents, develop and maintain playbooks and runbooks;
• monitor vulnerabilities, analyse their impact on the internal environment and coordinate their remediation with the various IT and trade teams;
• monitoring security events and producing associated safety reports and dashboards;
• define, maintain and evolve security KPIs;
• conduct security audits and forensic investigations;
• monitoring technological developments and cyber security trends to contribute to service innovation;
• collaborate on projects related to IT and trades. Profile:
• HES/EPF engineer training or equivalent;
• 3-5 years of experience in a similar position;
• in-depth understanding of information systems in Windows and Linux environments;
• strong expertise in systems security in IT and OT environments;
• good knowledge of several script and programming languages;
• familiar with the notions related to Threat Modeling, and MITRE, NIST, etc. framework;
• in-depth knowledge of Microsoft stack and XDR, SIEM, NDR and SOAR concepts;
• DevOps sensitivity and good knowledge of automation environments;
• hacker skills (white hat) and certifications SC-200, GIAC, OSCP, CEH an advantage;
• can-do, rigorous and integrity;
• good analytical and organizational skills;
• French or German mother tongue with very good knowledge of the second language and English Offer: A stimulating and diverse environment with the opportunity to leverage your knowledge and experience; attractive conditions of employment; opportunities for continuing training and further training. Find here all the advantages for our employees.

