descriptionByLocale.en:
The Valais Hospital is looking for a:

Specialist in Finance and Accounting with Federal Patent 50%

for the supplier, inventory and capital unit

Do you want to put your expertise at the service of rigorous financial management and contribute to the management of investments? Budgets, capital assets, reporting and improved monitoring tools will speed up your daily lives. Join our team and actively participate in our unit's financial performance.

Mission:
As a specialist in finance and accounting, you monitor the annual regular investments, from budget creation to closure. At the request of the manager, you support the unit in the monitoring of supplier and stock accounts. You are involved in the development and budgetary monitoring of regular and strategic investments, contribute to the management of capital assets, including the activation and disposal of assets, and collaborate on quarterly and annual transactions. You develop dashboards and reporting tools tailored to the needs of the unit, participate in the preparation of reports to the State of Valais and assist the person responsible in carrying out his or her various missions.

Profile:
